        "B": "$x^2 + (y-3)^2 = 3$",
        "C": "$x^2 + (y + 3)^2 = 9$",
        "D": "$x^2 + (y-3)^2 = 9$"
      },
      "correct_answer": "C",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Centro (0,-3) y radio 3 dan x²+(y+3)²=9."
